  "translation": "Yesterday was the weekend. My friend and I went to the park. There were flowers in the park. We entered through the park gate. My friend said we should go to the lake first. There were four big trees in front of the lake. Under the big trees there was a bench. We sat on the bench to rest. I brought a book, and my friend brought another book. We read together. Afterwards, my friend said this book was very interesting. Then we also went boating. There were several ducks on the lake. We had a lot of fun and rowed for two hours. We looked at the scenery again. Finally we were all tired, so we went home."
